{
 "_note": [
  "Named indicator families and whether this platform can build them.",
  "",
  "Every entry with status 'buildable' carries a real column spec, and",
  "tests/test_indicator_families.py builds each one and puts it through",
  "omega.validate and omega.space. If the platform's contract changes so a",
  "family stops being constructible, that test fails - the census cannot rot",
  "into a lie quietly.",
  "",
  "'blocked' entries carry a cause, which is the useful half:",
  "  operator-absent  the data is present, the equation is not",
  "  guard-refuses    the operator exists, the unit-clique rule rejects the pair",
  "  needs-state      requires recursive evaluation, not a new function",
  "  data-absent      the input genuinely does not exist",
  "",
  "Measured 2026-08-24 against the live connector."
 ],
